--- !u!114 &7291191253320391220
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1825210740685912784}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 36422ed2236b4ef4d88887b861d3bdcc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  buttonText:
    fi: "Hauet ovat t\xE4rke\xE4ss\xE4 asemassa muiden kalakantojen, kuten s\xE4rkien
      hillitsemisess\xE4, sill\xE4 ne saalistavat monia kalalajeja.\n\nNyky\xE4\xE4n
      hauen kanta on laskussa, koska monia hauelle t\xE4rkeit\xE4 elinymp\xE4rist\xF6j\xE4
      ja kutupaikkoja on tuhottu ihmisten toimesta.\u200B"
    sw: "G\xE4ddor spelar en viktig roll f\xF6r att kontrollera andra fiskbest\xE5nd,
      som m\xF6rt, eftersom de jagar m\xE5nga fiskarter.\nNuf\xF6rtiden minskar g\xE4ddbest\xE5ndet
      eftersom m\xE5nga viktiga livsmilj\xF6er och lekplatser f\xF6r g\xE4dda har
      f\xF6rst\xF6rts av m\xE4nsklig aktivitet."
    en: 'Pike play an important role in controlling other fish populations, such
      as roach, as they prey on many fish species.

      Nowadays, pike populations
      are declining because many important habitats and spawning grounds for pike
      have been destroyed by human activities.'
