--- !u!114 &4880385652128889183
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3752300061302600148}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 36422ed2236b4ef4d88887b861d3bdcc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  buttonText:
    fi: "<b>Hauki ja kosteikko\u200B</b>\n\nKosteikko on hyv\xE4 kutemisymp\xE4rist\xF6
      hauille, sill\xE4 kosteikot ovat matalia ja niiss\xE4 kasvaa ruokoja ja muita
      kasveja\r\nmelko tihe\xE4sti. \n\nKosteikko luo my\xF6s hyv\xE4n elinymp\xE4rist\xF6n
      hauen poikasille kasvaa. \n\nKosteikkoja kunnollistamalla pystyt\xE4\xE4nkin
      nostamaan mahdollisesti\r\nhaukikantoja, sill\xE4 kosteikot tarjoavat hyv\xE4n
      lis\xE4\xE4ntymis- ja kasvuymp\xE4rist\xF6n hauille."
    sw: "<b>G\xE4ddan och v\xE5tmarken</b>\n\nV\xE5tmarker \xE4r bra lekmilj\xF6er
      f\xF6r g\xE4ddor, eftersom v\xE5tmarker \xE4r grunda och vass och andra v\xE4xter
      v\xE4xer\nganska t\xE4tt d\xE4r.\nV\xE5tmarker skapar ocks\xE5 en bra livsmilj\xF6
      f\xF6r g\xE4ddyngel att v\xE4xa i.\nGenom att \xE5terst\xE4lla v\xE5tmarker
      kan man potentiellt \xF6ka\ng\xE4ddbest\xE5nden, eftersom v\xE5tmarker erbjuder
      en bra reproduktions- och tillv\xE4xtmilj\xF6 f\xF6r g\xE4ddor."
    en: '<b>Pike and Wetlands</b>


      Wetlands are good spawning environments
      for pike, as wetlands are shallow and reeds and other plants grow

      quite
      densely there.

      Wetlands also create a good habitat for pike fry to grow.

      By
      restoring wetlands, it may be possible to increase

      pike populations,
      as wetlands provide a good reproduction and growth environment for pike.'
